                en = {
                    change = {
                        "Developers' notes: The goal of this change is to make Dream Breath a flexible heal that can once again serve as a powerful heal over time effect or a burst heal when charged. This also further differentiates it from spells like Verdant Embrace and Merithra's Blessing, which have filled a similar role as an on-demand burst heal. Additionally, we're updating Consume Flame to be much more relevant and impactful, which it should be as Flameshaper's capstone talent.",
