                        "Hero Talents — Stormbringer：修复了单个Arc Discharge效果可以提高多个Chain Lightning法术施放（例如来自Thorim's Invocation and Ride the Lightning的法术）的伤害的问题。",
                        "Hero Talents — Totemic：Surging Totem Tremor 伤害降低 15%。",
                        "Hero Talents — Totemic：Surging Totem Surging Bolt的伤害降低10%。",
                        "Hero Talents — Totemic：修复了通过施放 Chain Lightning 产生的来自 Surging Totem 的 Surging Bolts 全部被发送到 Chain Lightning 击中的最后一个目标，而不是 Chain Lightning 的主要目标的问题。",
                    },
                    name = "Shaman",
                    source = "Blizzard",
                    sourceUrl = "https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24293281/curse-of-ula-tek-content-update-notes#item16",
